[{"answer":"Today's Health Counsel is presented by Paula Clayburg,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"who is the chief Counsellor at Liverpool's famous pain clinic:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The Wilton Clinic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Paula...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know what Prince Charles, Seve Ballesteros and Elizabeth Taylor have in common?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"They all suffer from chronic back pain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, bad backs are one of the most common health problems today,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"affecting people in all walks of life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The most recent available figures show that about a quarter of a million people","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"are incapacitated with back pain every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And many sufferers don't know the cause or the solution to their problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The majority of our patients at the clinic tend to be women.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"They are especially vulnerable because of pregnancy","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but also because of osteoporosis,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"which I personally believe to be the major cause of problems for women.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I have many women patients who say they have completely given up exercise","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"because the pain makes them so miserable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"But of course that starts up a vicious circle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Bed rest, giving up exercise and pain killers are traditional responses to back pain","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but, although there are many excellent drugs on the market,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"at our clinic we are beginning to realise the unique benefits of relaxation therapy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Other specialists in the field make a strong case for certain types of exercise,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"but in our experience they are easily mishandled","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and can lead to more harm than good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, let's look at some of the reasons why back pain is developing into such a unique menace.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"In general, the body is pretty good at self-repair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"A strain or a blow to a limb, though painful at the time, generally resolves itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"But the body's response to back injury can be very counter-productive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/28.mp3"},{"answer":"When pain strikes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/29.mp3"},{"answer":"we attempt to keep the back as immobile as possible,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/30.mp3"},{"answer":"which makes the muscles tense up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Research shows that they often go into spasm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/32.mp3"},{"answer":"which causes further twisting of the spine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/33.mp3"},{"answer":"A vicious circle is underway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The second mistake we often make when stricken with extreme back pain","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/35.mp3"},{"answer":"is to go to bed and stay there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Although at the clinic, we recognise that a short rest in bed can be helpful...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/37.mp3"},{"answer":"up to two days...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/38.mp3"},{"answer":"any longer makes our back muscles become weaker and unable to hold up our spine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/39.mp3"},{"answer":"The pain therefore becomes worse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Another problem is being overweight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyone a stone or more over-weight","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/42.mp3"},{"answer":"who already has back pain is not doing himself any favours:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/43.mp3"},{"answer":"though it won't actually set it off in the first place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/44.mp3"},{"answer":"the weight will increase the strain and make things worse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/45.mp3"},{"answer":"The British diet could be partially to blame for the increase in back pain:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/46.mp3"},{"answer":"over the last ten years the average weight of men has risen by 11 lbs","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and of women by 9 lbs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So much for the causes and aggravations of pain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/49.mp3"},{"answer":"But what can we do to help?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/50.mp3"},{"answer":"There are many ways in which simple day-to-day care can make all the difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The first point to watch of course is weight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/52.mp3"},{"answer":"If you are overweight, a diet will make all the difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, studies have shown that just one hour sitting in a slouched position","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/54.mp3"},{"answer":"can strain ligaments in the back which can take months to heal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/55.mp3"},{"answer":"At the clinic, we have come to the conclusion","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/56.mp3"},{"answer":"that the major cause of the problem is not with the design of chairs, as some have suggested,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but in the way we sit in them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It can be useful to get special orthopaedic chairs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/59.mp3"},{"answer":"but remember the most important improvement should be in our posture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Another enemy of your back is, of course, your beds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/61.mp3"},{"answer":"If your bed doesn't give enough support,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/62.mp3"},{"answer":"back muscles and ligaments work all night trying to correct spinal alignment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/63.mp3"},{"answer":"so you wake up with a tired aching back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Try out an orthopaedic mattress or a spring slatted bed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Research shows that both can be beneficial for certain types of back pain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Another hazard for your back are the shock waves which travel up your spine when you walk,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/67.mp3"},{"answer":"known as heel strike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/68.mp3"},{"answer":"A real find for our patients has been the shock-absorbing shoe insert.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/69.mp3"},{"answer":"A cheap but very effective solution.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And you might be better off avoiding shoes with heels higher than one and a half inches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Though absolutely flat shoes can be a solution for some,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/72.mp3"},{"answer":"others find their posture suffers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Finally, a word about the state-of-the-art relief - the TENS machine -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/74.mp3"},{"answer":"a small battery-powered gadget","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/75.mp3"},{"answer":"which delivers subliminal electrical pulses to the skin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Our experience indicates that your money is better spent on the more old-fashioned remedies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-1-part-4-2023-08-14-20-27-41/77.mp3"}]
